# Starring the important tasks across projects, checking them in the Starred view, unstarring one there, then seeing the starred ones in Today and finishing one.
file <<END
Work:
	- Budget review
	- Hire a designer
	- Team lunch
Home:
	- Call mom
	- Fix the bike
END
keys j * j *
keys G *
keys g*
see 󰓎 Starred
see - Budget review 󰓎  Work
see - Fix the bike 󰓎  Home
keys j *
hide Hire a designer
see ▌ - Fix the bike 󰓎  Home
keys gt
see 󰖙 Today
see - Budget review 󰓎  Work
hide Hire a designer
see ▌ - Fix the bike 󰓎  Home
keys gg x
see ✔ Budget review
keys gc
hide Budget review
keys gh
see Work:
hide Budget review
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Budget review @star @done({today})
	- Hire a designer
	- Team lunch
Home:
	- Call mom
	- Fix the bike @star
END
